{"4141930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Half Left", "steam_appid": 4141930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Half Left </strong>: a top-down horror shooter combining Cosmic Horror with dark humor.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CosmicCorp.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world’s leading authority in off-world research and planetary resource extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/2e5b5efc382dc5cc3e7a26b40ea4f555.avif?t=1781755028\" width=992 height=490 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The discovery marked a deviation from all known data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No classification could be assigned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shortly after recovery, the EAS-444 Complex began to exhibit irregularities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>invisible horror</strong> has been born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/14daf7eb02a28bd138ff1b0872a14a5a.poster.avif?t=1781755028\" width=920 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/14daf7eb02a28bd138ff1b0872a14a5a.webm?t=1781755028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/14daf7eb02a28bd138ff1b0872a14a5a.mp4?t=1781755028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a <strong>disabled nurse</strong>, trapped within the quarantined facility. Confined to your <strong>wheelchair</strong>, you must navigate collapsing corridors, manage scarce resources, and fight against horrors that twist flesh and thought alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique <strong>wheelchair-based movement system</strong> - precise, tense, and unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/40513dd841aba44568b16c862b8ee834.poster.avif?t=1781755028\" width=888 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/40513dd841aba44568b16c862b8ee834.webm?t=1781755028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/40513dd841aba44568b16c862b8ee834.mp4?t=1781755028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true <strong>immersive sim</strong> where every choice, system, and interaction shapes your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/13792fd21e2fb9bf3f6166000f066d5e.poster.avif?t=1781755028\" width=920 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/13792fd21e2fb9bf3f6166000f066d5e.webm?t=1781755028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/13792fd21e2fb9bf3f6166000f066d5e.mp4?t=1781755028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The body breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mind follows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The laughter stays.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Half Left </strong>: a top-down horror shooter combining Cosmic Horror with dark humor.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CosmicCorp.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world’s leading authority in off-world research and planetary resource extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/2e5b5efc382dc5cc3e7a26b40ea4f555.avif?t=1781755028\" width=992 height=490 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The discovery marked a deviation from all known data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No classification could be assigned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shortly after recovery, the EAS-444 Complex began to exhibit irregularities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>invisible horror</strong> has been born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/14daf7eb02a28bd138ff1b0872a14a5a.poster.avif?t=1781755028\" width=920 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/14daf7eb02a28bd138ff1b0872a14a5a.webm?t=1781755028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/14daf7eb02a28bd138ff1b0872a14a5a.mp4?t=1781755028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a <strong>disabled nurse</strong>, trapped within the quarantined facility. Confined to your <strong>wheelchair</strong>, you must navigate collapsing corridors, manage scarce resources, and fight against horrors that twist flesh and thought alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique <strong>wheelchair-based movement system</strong> - precise, tense, and unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/40513dd841aba44568b16c862b8ee834.poster.avif?t=1781755028\" width=888 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/40513dd841aba44568b16c862b8ee834.webm?t=1781755028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/40513dd841aba44568b16c862b8ee834.mp4?t=1781755028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true <strong>immersive sim</strong> where every choice, system, and interaction shapes your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/13792fd21e2fb9bf3f6166000f066d5e.poster.avif?t=1781755028\" width=920 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/13792fd21e2fb9bf3f6166000f066d5e.webm?t=1781755028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141930/extras/13792fd21e2fb9bf3f6166000f066d5e.mp4?t=1781755028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The body breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mind follows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The laughter stays.</p>", "short_description": "Trapped inside a quarantined research complex, a wheelchair-bound nurse must survive a curse beyond human comprehension.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Vietnamese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_ima